msgid "[ ] What can people do with this work?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_reviewer-guidelines.md:428
msgid "[ ] Is the problem important?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_reviewer-guidelines.md:430
msgid "**Originality:**"
