#: ../../source/references_reviewer-guidelines.md:431
msgid "[ ] What specifically is new here?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_reviewer-guidelines.md:432
msgid "[ ] How does this differ from closest related work?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_reviewer-guidelines.md:433
msgid "[ ] Is the contribution non-trivial?"
